WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:05.433
Ta-daaa!

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.266
- What’s that?
- Pika?

3
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:09.766
- The Battle Chateau!
- Battle Chateau?

4
00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:11.700
- I’ve never heard of it before.
- Huh?

5
00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:15.899
Ash, you’re going to love this place! It’s nearby, so let’s go!

6
00:00:15.966 --> 00:00:18.700
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

7
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:21.500
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

8
00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:25.166
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

9
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:28.200
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

10
00:00:28.266 --> 00:00:31.266
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

11
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:34.533
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

12
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.900
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

13
00:00:37.966 --> 00:00:40.333
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

14
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.833
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

15
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.900
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

16
00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:57.366
When you have a battle at the Battle Chateau,

17
00:00:57.433 --> 00:01:00.800
the winning Trainer earns something, though I’m not sure just what.

18
00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:02.199
That sounds cool!

19
00:01:02.266 --> 00:01:04.000
Maybe you’re awarded some kind of badge!

20
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:07.666
Or a cake! I love cake!

21
00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.066
Now, let’s see.

22
00:01:11.266 --> 00:01:14.433
- Noble title, yo!
- Fletchinder! Fletchinder!

23
00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:18.433
Who’s that Pokémon?

24
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.966
Fletchinder, the Ember Pokémon

25
00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.033
and the evolved form of Fletchling.

26
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.033
Fletchinder flies faster and faster

27
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.766
as the flame sac on its stomach gradually heats up.

28
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:29.833
Chinder!

29
00:01:29.899 --> 00:01:33.200
- The evolved form of Fletchling, huh?
- Yo, yo, yo!

30
00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:37.133
- A Pokédex in my face, not cool, bro!
- Sorry about that.

31
00:01:37.199 --> 00:01:39.333
- So what’s a noble title?
- Pika?

32
00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:42.733
Nico, he actually listened to what you said. Yo, yo!

33
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.666
Yo, yo! You’re not from around here, yo.

34
00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:48.899
Check out the legendary Rivière Walk, yo.

35
00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:51.466
You should learn it if you’re going to be here, yo!

36
00:01:51.533 --> 00:01:54.133
- Uh...
- Do you think they’re rapping?

37
00:01:54.199 --> 00:01:55.766
Huh?

38
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:58.399
So, noble title?

39
00:01:58.466 --> 00:02:00.633
It’s a real pain to explain, yo!

40
00:02:00.699 --> 00:02:03.466
But we’re heading to the Battle Chateau now, yo!

41
00:02:03.533 --> 00:02:06.566
Come with us and check it out for yourself, yo!

42
00:02:06.633 --> 00:02:08.699
Great! Let’s all go together!

43
00:02:08.766 --> 00:02:12.100
It’ll be the perfect warm-up before I challenge the Cyllage Gym!

44
00:02:12.166 --> 00:02:14.166
- Pikachu!
- Warm up?

45
00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:17.900
I wouldn’t be too sure about that. It may be tougher than you think!

46
00:02:17.966 --> 00:02:20.333
You’re going to be floored when you get there, yo!

47
00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.133
By the way, I’m Ash.

48
00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.500
- And this is my partner, Pikachu!
- Pikachu!

49
00:02:24.566 --> 00:02:27.000
I’m Clemont. It’s a pleasure to meet you.

50
00:02:27.066 --> 00:02:28.333
And I’m Bonnie.

51
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.566
Serena’s my name. Hi there!

52
00:02:30.633 --> 00:02:33.966
I’m Nico and my partner is Fletchinder!

53
00:02:34.033 --> 00:02:37.533
And I’m Chester. My partner is Fletchling, yo!

54
00:02:41.066 --> 00:02:44.566
So today’s the first time you challenge the Battle Chateau, Chester?

55
00:02:44.633 --> 00:02:46.500
Uh-huh! It sure is!

56
00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:49.000
I already have a Battle Chateau title.

57
00:02:49.066 --> 00:02:51.333
My brother’s gotten really good at battling.

58
00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.166
- Ha-ha!
- So I figured it’s time for his debut!

59
00:02:54.233 --> 00:02:56.433
They’re finally not talking weird.

60
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.733
Yo! There it is, yo!

61
00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.466
Wow! Check it out!

62
00:03:02.533 --> 00:03:04.966
- Pika!
- It’s gorgeous!

63
00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:10.899
Huh? What’s written up there?

64
00:03:10.966 --> 00:03:13.933
“Battle Chateau. Show your strength with a title!”

65
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.766
Hm...

66
00:03:19.466 --> 00:03:21.233
Beautiful!

67
00:03:23.466 --> 00:03:28.899
Hello, Baron Nico! The Battle Chateau welcomes you with open arms.

68
00:03:28.966 --> 00:03:30.299
- Baron?
- Pika?

69
00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:36.600
I brought my brother along with me today. He’d like his debut battle.

70
00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:38.866
I’m Chester. Very pleased to meet you.

71
00:03:38.933 --> 00:03:42.066
- I’d like to have a battle, too!
- Oh. And you’re...?

72
00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:45.799
I’m Ash and I come from Pallet Town in the Kanto region.

73
00:03:45.866 --> 00:03:47.833
- Pikachu!
- Well, well.

74
00:03:47.899 --> 00:03:50.200
It’s the honorable Baron Nico.

75
00:03:50.266 --> 00:03:52.833
It’s a pleasure to see your brother make his debut.

76
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:56.333
- Thank you.
- This is the Chateau owner, Duke Turner.

77
00:03:56.399 --> 00:03:59.766
Pleased to meet you. It is my honor to welcome a guest

78
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:02.433
who traveled all the way from the Kanto region.

79
00:04:04.233 --> 00:04:07.066
Our Chateau provides a fulfilling battle experience

80
00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:11.233
and serves as a meeting place for all the many Trainers who visit here.

81
00:04:11.299 --> 00:04:14.133
- Ash, this place sounds perfect for you!
- Yeah!

82
00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.366
Now, the first thing to know is

83
00:04:16.433 --> 00:04:19.800
all Trainers at the Battle Chateau are referred to as knights.

84
00:04:19.866 --> 00:04:24.099
Knights! What an appropriate title for Trainers battling at a castle!

85
00:04:24.166 --> 00:04:29.233
Hm, true. Then each and every knight has a noble title bestowed upon them

86
00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:32.366
that is based on the grand total of their Battle Chateau victories.

87
00:04:32.433 --> 00:04:37.166
I wish you the best of luck in earning your highest possible noble title.

88
00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:40.533
Allow me to show you the Battle Chateau sitting room.

89
00:04:40.599 --> 00:04:44.800
Each time you visit here, this is where you’ll be choosing a battling adversary.

90
00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.333
Wow!

91
00:04:53.966 --> 00:04:57.733
Ladies and gentlemen, I have the distinct honor to present Baron Nico.

92
00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:01.200
Hm?

93
00:05:01.266 --> 00:05:02.766
Wow!

94
00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:05.000
So everybody here is a knight?

95
00:05:05.066 --> 00:05:07.833
Right! This is a great place to hang out with other Trainers,

96
00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.566
trade stories and information and also look for an opponent!

97
00:05:10.633 --> 00:05:13.066
Yeah! So you battle who you want?

98
00:05:13.133 --> 00:05:17.166
Not exactly. There’s a catch. You have to be the same noble title.

99
00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:20.666
- Pi! Pikapi! Pika, Pika!
- Huh?

100
00:05:20.733 --> 00:05:23.566
What’s that guy doing up there?!

101
00:05:23.633 --> 00:05:25.933
Wow, who is he anyway?

102
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.833
Oh, yeah, that guy’s name is Grant. He’s always climbing walls.

103
00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.466
- Yeah, he’s really strong!
- Strong, huh?

104
00:05:36.533 --> 00:05:40.700
Any Barons here who would be willing to accept a battle challenge from me?

105
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:43.700
- Huh?
- Pika?

106
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:49.366
I’ll accept your challenge.

107
00:05:49.433 --> 00:05:52.800
My name is Baron Farrell. How do you do!

108
00:05:52.866 --> 00:05:54.433
It’s a pleasure to meet you.

109
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.433
I’m looking forward to our battle.

110
00:06:00.866 --> 00:06:06.066
All right, Nico and Farrell, please proceed to the battlefield.

111
00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:10.666
All other knights may watch the battle from the outside terrace.

112
00:06:18.633 --> 00:06:22.000
Huh?

113
00:06:29.099 --> 00:06:30.299
Hey, that’s Ash!

114
00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:36.666
- Check out the capes!
- So cool!

115
00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:38.533
- It’s a tradition.
- Huh?

116
00:06:38.599 --> 00:06:41.900
The atmosphere here is quite different from a Pokémon Gym.

117
00:06:41.966 --> 00:06:46.700
True! The Battle Chateau was founded on the principles of a knights’ duel.

118
00:06:46.766 --> 00:06:51.666
The aim is to elevate Pokémon battles through the spirit of chivalry.

119
00:06:51.733 --> 00:06:54.000
It became much more than two powerful Trainers

120
00:06:54.066 --> 00:06:57.633
simply battling along with their greatest Pokémon in a clash of moves.

121
00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:02.366
A battle culture that held civility in high regard was born.

122
00:07:02.433 --> 00:07:05.866
Nowadays, Gym Battles have become the mainstream,

123
00:07:05.933 --> 00:07:08.633
but many people enjoy the Battle Chateau

124
00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:12.299
as something they can only experience in the Kalos region.

125
00:07:12.366 --> 00:07:14.866
Wearing those capes is so awesome.

126
00:07:14.933 --> 00:07:17.299
Yeah. White capes are worn only by Barons.

127
00:07:17.366 --> 00:07:20.299
-So how many noble titles are there?

128
00:07:20.366 --> 00:07:24.033
Baron is the first noble title.

129
00:07:24.099 --> 00:07:27.466
Then there’s Viscount. Earl is number three.

130
00:07:27.533 --> 00:07:30.266
Then there’s Marquis. Number five is Duke.

131
00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:32.299
And the highest title is Grand Duke!

132
00:07:32.366 --> 00:07:34.666
Wow, that’s a lot!

133
00:07:36.366 --> 00:07:39.066
- To a good battle!
- To a good battle!

134
00:07:39.133 --> 00:07:44.000
The Pokémon battle between Baron Nico and Baron Farrell is about to commence.

135
00:07:44.066 --> 00:07:47.933
If Baron Nico is victorious, that will be his tenth victory,

136
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.166
allowing him to ascend to the noble title of Viscount.

137
00:07:51.233 --> 00:07:55.900
May you both battle with spirit, while observing the knight’s code of chivalry!

138
00:07:55.966 --> 00:07:59.466
- Fletchinder, come on out!
- Fletchy!

139
00:07:59.533 --> 00:08:03.033
- Dusknoir, let’s go!
- Dusknoir!

140
00:08:03.099 --> 00:08:06.566
- Ow, they’re so cute!
- A Dusknoir!

141
00:08:06.633 --> 00:08:10.033
Wow, I’ve never seen one.

142
00:08:10.099 --> 00:08:12.400
Dusknoir, the Gripper Pokémon.

143
00:08:12.466 --> 00:08:16.000
Dusknoir is said to travel between the human and spirit worlds.

144
00:08:16.066 --> 00:08:20.099
Nico will win. His Fletchinder is super-powerful!

145
00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:23.299
- Use Thunder Punch!
- Dusk!

146
00:08:23.366 --> 00:08:29.099
- Use Flame Charge, go!
- Fletchinder!

147
00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:30.900
It’s gone!

148
00:08:30.966 --> 00:08:32.633
Fletchinder!

149
00:08:32.699 --> 00:08:34.500
- Dusknoir!
- Fletch!

150
00:08:34.566 --> 00:08:37.566
- Fletchinder’s hit!
- Ghost types are so scary!

151
00:08:37.633 --> 00:08:39.166
They can disappear and reappear!

152
00:08:39.233 --> 00:08:43.433
Electric-type moves are super effective against Flying types!

153
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.433
Fletchy!

154
00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.633
Fletchinder!

155
00:08:48.699 --> 00:08:50.866
- Wow, look at Fletchinder go!
- Awesome!

156
00:08:50.933 --> 00:08:54.733
- Fletchy! Fletchinder!
- Dusknoir!

157
00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.600
That Flame Charge was powerful!

158
00:08:57.666 --> 00:09:01.300
Right! Nico and Fletchinder trained really hard for this battle!

159
00:09:01.366 --> 00:09:04.633
- Yoo-hoo?
- Huh? Viola!

160
00:09:04.699 --> 00:09:08.233
Hey there, Ash! Who would have thought I’d be running into you?

161
00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:11.133
- What are you doing here?
- I love the Chateau.

162
00:09:11.199 --> 00:09:13.666
Actually, I have the noble title of Duchess.

163
00:09:13.733 --> 00:09:15.000
Duchess?

164
00:09:15.066 --> 00:09:19.466
It’s the second-highest title. See, it’s the female equivalent of Duke.

165
00:09:19.533 --> 00:09:23.699
Oh, wow. So you must have won a lot of battles to be a Duchess!

166
00:09:23.766 --> 00:09:25.500
Dusknoir!

167
00:09:25.566 --> 00:09:27.666
- That’s it!
- Fletchinder!

168
00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:30.433
And Fletchinder is the winning Pokémon!

169
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.333
Chinder!

170
00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:38.566
- All right, Nico won!
- That Fletchinder is strong!

171
00:09:38.633 --> 00:09:42.266
Now that Nico has ten victories, his noble title will change.

172
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:45.733
He goes from the noble title of Baron to the title of Viscount.

173
00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.466
Excellent! We applaud the two gifted knights

174
00:09:48.533 --> 00:09:51.000
and their Pokémon for their valiant battle.

175
00:09:51.066 --> 00:09:52.066
-Huh?

176
00:09:52.133 --> 00:09:54.100
- What was that?!
- Pika?

177
00:09:54.166 --> 00:09:56.433
Huh? Not again.

178
00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.633
Grant, once more?

179
00:09:59.699 --> 00:10:02.600
I’m afraid I just couldn't help but applaud.

180
00:10:02.666 --> 00:10:05.800
It was to show my respect for such a brilliant battle.

181
00:10:05.866 --> 00:10:10.566
But, Grant, if you felt that way, why didn’t you come down first?

182
00:10:10.633 --> 00:10:13.066
Because the wall refuses to let me go.

183
00:10:13.133 --> 00:10:16.500
The walls here are so smooth. They're irresistible.

184
00:10:16.566 --> 00:10:18.466
They draw me to them.

185
00:10:18.533 --> 00:10:23.266
You do see the delicate beauty of the Battle Chateau’s walls, don’t you, Viola?

186
00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:27.300
Talk about their beauty all you want, but I’ll never understand the appeal of walls.

187
00:10:27.366 --> 00:10:29.533
So you know this guy, Viola?

188
00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:33.300
His name is Grant. He’s never seen a wall around here he didn’t love.

189
00:10:33.366 --> 00:10:35.300
Also, he’s strong.

190
00:10:35.366 --> 00:10:37.733
- Ha! They told me the rules.
- Pika.

191
00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.466
I’d like to battle you, so I was wondering what your title is.

192
00:10:40.533 --> 00:10:43.666
- Pika!
- My noble title is Duke.

193
00:10:43.733 --> 00:10:46.333
Duke is the second-highest title you can get!

194
00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.733
- Now, then...
- Huh?

195
00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:51.166
Let us proceed to the debut battle involving the two knights

196
00:10:51.233 --> 00:10:53.233
who have come here for the first time today.

197
00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:57.866
- New knights?
- Yeah, Turner’s talking about us!

198
00:10:57.933 --> 00:11:00.866
-Pika!

199
00:11:00.933 --> 00:11:03.400
Who’s that Pokémon?

200
00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:10.033
It’s Fletchinder!

201
00:11:14.933 --> 00:11:17.866
Please give the knights who are about to have their first battle

202
00:11:17.933 --> 00:11:19.933
at the Battle Chateau a round of applause.

203
00:11:22.866 --> 00:11:26.199
So you say you’ve battled against Ash before?

204
00:11:26.266 --> 00:11:30.233
He’s a gutsy Trainer, that’s for sure, as are his Pokémon.

205
00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:35.533
They’re quite amazing. Once you see his passion and drive, I’m sure you’ll agree.

206
00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:38.699
Ash and Chester, whoever wins this first battle

207
00:11:38.766 --> 00:11:41.333
will then be awarded the noble title of Baron.

208
00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.166
- Right!
- Well, I’ve been training

209
00:11:43.233 --> 00:11:45.966
long and hard for this day! I’m going to win!

210
00:11:46.033 --> 00:11:48.533
Then let’s get underway.

211
00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:52.533
- To a good battle!
- Oh, yeah! To a good battle!

212
00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.466
- Okay, Pikachu, get in there!
- Pikachu!

213
00:12:01.533 --> 00:12:04.166
Hold on. What was in Ash’s Poké Ball?

214
00:12:04.233 --> 00:12:06.600
You see, that’s Pikachu’s Poké Ball.

215
00:12:06.666 --> 00:12:08.500
Pikachu doesn’t like being inside it,

216
00:12:08.566 --> 00:12:10.666
- so it stays out.
- Yeah?

217
00:12:10.733 --> 00:12:12.166
This is our first battle here.

218
00:12:12.233 --> 00:12:15.000
- I want to win it with you!
- Pika, Pika!

219
00:12:15.066 --> 00:12:18.633
And my Pokémon? It’s Fletchling!

220
00:12:18.699 --> 00:12:22.733
Fletch! Fletchling!

221
00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.000
Fletchling’s a Flying type!

222
00:12:26.066 --> 00:12:29.400
We’ve been training right alongside Nico’s Fletchinder!

223
00:12:29.466 --> 00:12:31.533
It’ll be able to take anything you try!

224
00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.733
Now, let the battle begin!

225
00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.000
All right! Use Thunderbolt!

226
00:12:36.066 --> 00:12:37.333
Pikachu!

227
00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.966
Agility!

228
00:12:39.033 --> 00:12:40.833
Fletchling!

229
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.566
You won’t get away! Use Electro Ball!

230
00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:48.900
Ash is starting off strong!

231
00:12:48.966 --> 00:12:53.166
Perhaps. Although Flying-type Pokémon are weak against Electric-type moves,

232
00:12:53.233 --> 00:12:56.199
it doesn’t mean anything if those moves don’t connect.

233
00:12:56.266 --> 00:12:58.266
Strength can only take you so far.

234
00:12:58.333 --> 00:13:00.433
Pikachu!

235
00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.566
- Use Feather Dance!
- Chling, Chling, Chling, Chling!

236
00:13:03.633 --> 00:13:06.366
- Fletchling! Fletchling!
- Pika?

237
00:13:06.433 --> 00:13:07.800
What’s going on?

238
00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:10.333
We just lowered Pikachu’s attack power!

239
00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:13.199
- Now, Steel Wing!
- Fletch!

240
00:13:13.266 --> 00:13:17.433
- We won’t lose! Iron Tail, let’s go!
- Pika! Chu! Pikachu!

241
00:13:18.666 --> 00:13:20.666
- Huh?
- Pikachu’s Iron Tail is weaker

242
00:13:20.733 --> 00:13:22.066
than it normally is.

243
00:13:22.133 --> 00:13:24.133
Feather Dance is an amazing move.

244
00:13:24.199 --> 00:13:25.800
Ash and Pikachu, do it!

245
00:13:25.866 --> 00:13:27.833
- Fletchling, use Steel Wing!
- Fletchling!

246
00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:31.733
- Use Iron Tail one more time!
- Pika? Pi! Pika! Pikachu!

247
00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.966
But Pikachu’s attack power is down!

248
00:13:36.033 --> 00:13:38.500
If one hit isn’t enough, we’ll just hit a bunch of times!

249
00:13:38.566 --> 00:13:40.866
Huh?

250
00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:43.599
You know? You were right about Ash’s strength.

251
00:13:43.666 --> 00:13:44.833
See?

252
00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:48.866
With the strength to deal with adversity, looks like this battle’s already over.

253
00:13:48.933 --> 00:13:51.666
Now, check out Pikachu’s Thunderbolt!

254
00:13:51.733 --> 00:13:54.599
Pikachu!

255
00:13:56.033 --> 00:13:57.733
Oh, no!

256
00:13:59.366 --> 00:14:01.633
Fletch!

257
00:14:01.699 --> 00:14:05.133
That’s it! And Pikachu is the winning Pokémon!

258
00:14:08.533 --> 00:14:10.833
Thank you very much!

259
00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:13.900
- Pika!
- I knew you’d win it, Pikachu!

260
00:14:13.966 --> 00:14:15.699
Pikachu!

261
00:14:15.766 --> 00:14:19.133
You were strong too, Fletchling. Thanks for working so hard!

262
00:14:19.199 --> 00:14:22.066
- Chester lost!
- There’s always next time.

263
00:14:22.133 --> 00:14:24.933
Yeah. He’ll just have to train with me more.

264
00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.466
Today’s loss is tomorrow’s win!

265
00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:29.533
And now I'm pleased to announce

266
00:14:29.599 --> 00:14:33.633
that Ash from Pallet Town is awarded the noble title of Baron.

267
00:14:33.699 --> 00:14:37.766
- Congratulations.
- Ha-ha! I’m a Baron now!

268
00:14:37.833 --> 00:14:39.900
Pikachu!

269
00:14:39.966 --> 00:14:42.733
Bummer I lost, but congratulations!

270
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.133
Hm!

271
00:14:48.599 --> 00:14:50.933
A picture to mark your first victory here!

272
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.933
-Now smile!

273
00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.366
- Huh?
- Pika?

274
00:14:54.433 --> 00:14:56.933
- A white glove!
- Someone’s challenging you!

275
00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.699
I was wondering when he’d finally ask me.

276
00:15:01.566 --> 00:15:03.199
Hi, Grant!

277
00:15:03.266 --> 00:15:06.766
Duchess Viola, I would like to challenge you to a battle.

278
00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:10.300
And I accept.

279
00:15:15.766 --> 00:15:18.966
To a good battle.

280
00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.133
Everybody out!

281
00:15:23.199 --> 00:15:24.400
- Froakie!
- Fletchling!

282
00:15:24.466 --> 00:15:27.466
Hey, Ash, I didn’t know you had a Fletchling, too.

283
00:15:27.533 --> 00:15:30.000
Yeah. Everybody, let’s cheer for Viola!

284
00:15:30.066 --> 00:15:31.533
- Froakie!
- Fletchling!

285
00:15:31.599 --> 00:15:33.333
The Chateau Pokémon battle between

286
00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:36.099
Duchess Viola and Duke Grant will now commence.

287
00:15:36.166 --> 00:15:38.766
Both only need but one more victory,

288
00:15:38.833 --> 00:15:44.166
so whoever wins this battle will ascend to become Grand Duke or Grand Duchess,

289
00:15:44.233 --> 00:15:46.699
the highest noble title possible!

290
00:15:46.766 --> 00:15:51.466
- All right, Surskit, let’s go!
- Surskit!

291
00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:54.233
- It’s Surskit!
- Pika!

292
00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.166
Onix, you’re on!

293
00:16:01.666 --> 00:16:02.966
Wow. It’s huge!

294
00:16:03.033 --> 00:16:05.366
Onix! That’s a Rock type!

295
00:16:05.433 --> 00:16:07.099
It’s amazing!

296
00:16:08.466 --> 00:16:11.000
Onix, the Rock Snake Pokémon.

297
00:16:11.066 --> 00:16:15.466
Onix takes in enormous amounts of soil through its mouth, creating long tunnels.

298
00:16:15.533 --> 00:16:16.800
Begin!

299
00:16:16.866 --> 00:16:22.699
- Surskit, use Ice Beam!
- Surskit!

300
00:16:22.766 --> 00:16:25.400
I thought you’d be using that strategy.

301
00:16:25.466 --> 00:16:27.800
Speed may be one of your specialties,

302
00:16:27.866 --> 00:16:30.866
but I’ll stop you in your tracks! Use Rock Tomb!

303
00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.199
Yeah? My Surskit won’t be stopped as easily as you think!

304
00:16:35.266 --> 00:16:37.000
Go!

305
00:16:37.066 --> 00:16:40.000
-Surs!

306
00:16:40.066 --> 00:16:41.900
What’s going on with that Rock Tomb?

307
00:16:41.966 --> 00:16:43.633
It’s controlling the boulders!

308
00:16:43.699 --> 00:16:45.599
Grant must have trained hard to do that!

309
00:16:45.666 --> 00:16:48.099
He’s obviously no ordinary Trainer!

310
00:16:48.166 --> 00:16:50.466
Surskit!

311
00:16:50.533 --> 00:16:52.733
Surskit, use Bubble Beam!

312
00:16:54.166 --> 00:16:58.933
Surs! Surs! Surskit! Surs, Surs, Surskit!

313
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:02.699
- Use Protect!
- Surskit! Surs, Surs, Surskit!

314
00:17:04.466 --> 00:17:06.133
Huh, you dodged that well.

315
00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:10.800
- Now use Signal Beam!
- Surskit!

316
00:17:10.866 --> 00:17:16.599
Use Flash Cannon!

317
00:17:16.666 --> 00:17:18.533
- Now! Get closer!
- Surskit!

318
00:17:18.599 --> 00:17:19.833
Rock Polish!

319
00:17:25.466 --> 00:17:29.100
It’s getting faster! Onix is outmaneuvering Surskit!

320
00:17:29.166 --> 00:17:31.633
Just like a Duke’s Pokémon! Off the charts!

321
00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.399
Your power and speed have improved tremendously!

322
00:17:34.466 --> 00:17:35.866
You’re too kind.

323
00:17:35.933 --> 00:17:39.433
- Use Ice Beam!
- Surskit!

324
00:17:41.899 --> 00:17:43.600
Onix, jump!

325
00:17:47.366 --> 00:17:49.300
-Whoa! What a jump!

326
00:17:49.366 --> 00:17:51.266
Now use Rock Tomb!

327
00:17:54.766 --> 00:17:57.200
Surskit! Surskit!

328
00:17:57.266 --> 00:17:59.733
It’s over. Use Flash Cannon.

329
00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.866
Surskit, no!!

330
00:18:11.033 --> 00:18:14.533
That’s it! Onix is the winning Pokémon!

331
00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:18.200
Surskit, you were wonderful.

332
00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.933
You battled well. You win. And you’re a Grand Duke now!

333
00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.266
Well, it’s all because of Onix’s hard work.

334
00:18:31.333 --> 00:18:33.933
Onix earned it. And gets all the credit!

335
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.399
Awesome!

336
00:18:35.466 --> 00:18:36.866
- Pika.
- Froakie!

337
00:18:36.933 --> 00:18:39.433
That Rock Tomb was totally incredible!

338
00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.533
Not just that, its moves, combined with its ease of getting around

339
00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.433
make it unbelievable!

340
00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.833
And strong, too!

341
00:18:46.899 --> 00:18:50.566
They’re in a league of their own. I never would have guessed!

342
00:18:52.566 --> 00:18:54.566
- Grant?
- Huh?

343
00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.533
That battle was the best ever!

344
00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.966
I want to raise my title just so I can battle you someday!

345
00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.933
Me, too! Now I’ve got one more goal!

346
00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.966
I lost today, but tomorrow I’ll win!

347
00:19:05.033 --> 00:19:07.633
It’s a tough climb, but I’ll be here!

348
00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:12.333
Oh, yes. So I’ve been told that you’re challenging several Gyms.

349
00:19:12.399 --> 00:19:13.766
That's right!

350
00:19:13.833 --> 00:19:16.500
Then we’ll probably be seeing each other at the Gym first

351
00:19:16.566 --> 00:19:18.666
- before we battle back here.
- Huh?

352
00:19:18.733 --> 00:19:21.700
You see, Grant’s the Cyllage City Gym Leader.

353
00:19:23.466 --> 00:19:25.566
You’re the Cyllage Gym Leader?!

354
00:19:25.633 --> 00:19:29.000
The Cyllage City Gym is the one Ash is going to challenge next!

355
00:19:29.066 --> 00:19:30.700
That’s why you’re so strong!

356
00:19:30.766 --> 00:19:33.366
Two Gym Leaders battling each other! Wow!

357
00:19:33.433 --> 00:19:37.066
You used Onix, so that means your Gym is a Rock-type Gym!

358
00:19:37.133 --> 00:19:39.166
Uh, you’re exactly right.

359
00:19:39.233 --> 00:19:40.566
Rock type, huh?

360
00:19:40.633 --> 00:19:43.333
You know, your Pikachu is quite strong.

361
00:19:43.399 --> 00:19:47.600
I’ll be looking forward to the day you come and challenge me at the Cyllage Gym.

362
00:19:47.666 --> 00:19:49.566
- Great!
- Pikachu!

363
00:19:49.633 --> 00:19:51.033
Until then!

364
00:19:52.899 --> 00:19:55.433
You’ll need to come up with a strategy that can counter

365
00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.066
that powerful Rock Tomb if you want to win a badge.

366
00:19:58.133 --> 00:20:02.133
Yeah. I’ll be ready! We’ll train like there’s no tomorrow!

367
00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.500
- Pika!
- Froakie!

368
00:20:04.566 --> 00:20:06.066
Fletchling, Fletch!

369
00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:12.300
Nico, Chester, thanks for showing us this cool place.

370
00:20:12.366 --> 00:20:16.766
- No worries, yo!
- Good luck with your Gym battle, yo, yo!

371
00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:18.466
Here we go with the yos, yo.

372
00:20:18.533 --> 00:20:20.800
- Yo, yo! They’re contagious!
- Ah!

373
00:20:20.866 --> 00:20:24.533
We’re going to become a whole lot stronger and the next time you see us,

374
00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.399
you’ll be looking at two Grand Dukes, yo, baby, yo!

375
00:20:27.466 --> 00:20:29.300
Look forward to it, yo!

376
00:20:29.366 --> 00:20:33.033
Yeah! I’ll be a lot stronger next time, too! See you then!

377
00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:34.433
Pikachu!

378
00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.600
A visit to the Battle Chateau has not only given our heroes

379
00:20:37.666 --> 00:20:38.966
a memorable experience,

380
00:20:39.033 --> 00:20:43.133
but also introduced Ash to Grant, the Gym Leader of Cyllage City!

381
00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:47.066
Excitement is in the air, as the journey continues!
